{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、まりかとみなみが\n私のお家にお泊りしにきました(*^o^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おとまり～  おとまり～っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おふざけ 沢山したよっ ＼^o^／  ！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わちゃわちゃっ )^o^(  )^o^( 爆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真を撮るのにね、何回も笑っちゃって撮れなくて\n大変だったんだよー（笑）（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ほんと楽しかった！(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２人とも、また来てね～(=^ω^=)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、生駒っちとおしりを\n可憐にさわる戦いをして遊びました(*^ω^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒っちと おしり合いになれたぜ！へっへへーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問回答いきまーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○にゃんの今一番やりたい事、やってみたい事は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今やりたいことは、\nもっと勉強がしたいです ！＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やってみたいことは、資格を取ること...かな(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○和菓子と洋菓子でそれぞれ１番好きなのを教えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和菓子なら、あんみつが好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洋菓子なら、バタークッキーが一番好きです(*^_^*)\n大好きな牛乳やカフェオレと一緒に食べるのが"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(#^.^#)\n自分でも作ったりするけど、お母さんに頼んで実家から送ってもらうくらい好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○さゆにゃんはサーティワンに行ったら頼むのやっぱトリプル？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べるの遅くって溶けちゃうから...(*´pω･｡)うむむ\nシングルで十分かもですっ (> <  )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○さゆにゃんの好きなたまご料理は何ですか？？(^w^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホットケーキと、ドーナツ！！\nクッキーにクレープに...（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、お母さんの作るたまごスープが一番です。(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○さゆにゃんって嫌いな食べ物とかある!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お魚が苦手です(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくにお刺身とかの生魚が苦手で（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは、とろろとかも\n食べられないです（ ;  ; ）かゆかゆ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、今日も一日\nお疲れさまです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もいい日になりますようにっ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/5938593/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}